WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.696
YOU ARE 4,000 YEARS LATE.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.644
ONE OF YOU WILL BETRAY THE KINGDOM.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.168
FORGET EXPLAINING, WE NEED TO GET OUT OF HERE!

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.808
YOUR ONLY CHANCE TO SURVIVE.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.828
GUYS! LESS TALKING, MORE RUNNING!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.768
I swear... I don't know what he's talking about!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.108
THE FLOOR IS DISAPPEARING!

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.432
STAY ON THE LEFT! THE RIGHT SIDE IS COLLAPSING!

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.188
WAIT! DON'T MOVE! THE SYMBOLS SHOW WHICH STONES ARE SAFE!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:39.766
THE GATE IS CLOSING! MOVE!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.680
I CAN'T GET THROUGH!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.400
THAT CHAIN! PULL IT!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.040
HOW DOES THIS PLACE KNOW WHO WE ARE?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.384
SOMEBODY CAME THROUGH HERE. FOOTPRINTS IN DUST.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.088
