I feel like I've been here before... but I haven't.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.680
Look! A way out!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.608
This looks powerful.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.128
Messi, don't!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.632
It's the only way!

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.184
